    "detailed_description": "The Hell Inside is an action roguelike taking place in familiar places turned unfamiliar.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWaking up with nothing but a book as a weapon, you must battle through hordes of monsters that do not seem to have a place here.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe book is your weapon, and your only one. Your life depends on it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe book starts out as as a weak projectile, but with the power of adding pages with upgrades written on them, the book can change and morph into what is needed. Upgrades range drastically with some playing a more supportive role such as a laser sight or a more offensive role, like changing your projectiles into knives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew pages can also be written by finding ink during runs. These pages can be written before a run starts to have a chance of dropping during the next run.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEscape The Hell Inside",
    "about_the_game": "The Hell Inside is an action roguelike taking place in familiar places turned unfamiliar.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWaking up with nothing but a book as a weapon, you must battle through hordes of monsters that do not seem to have a place here.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe book is your weapon, and your only one. Your life depends on it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe book starts out as as a weak projectile, but with the power of adding pages with upgrades written on them, the book can change and morph into what is needed. Upgrades range drastically with some playing a more supportive role such as a laser sight or a more offensive role, like changing your projectiles into knives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew pages can also be written by finding ink during runs. These pages can be written before a run starts to have a chance of dropping during the next run.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEscape The Hell Inside",
    "short_description": "An action roguelike about escaping familiar places. Use your book to survive hordes of enemies and add new pages to the book to change how it works. Escape The Hell Inside.",
